mission "The Meridian Screen"
    name "The Meridian Screen"
    description "Sink the five screen ships in the Last Light Passage, then return to Last Light for the final pursuit orders."
    source "Mermaid's Rest"
    destination "Last Light"
    reward 1480
    objective kills 5
    battlefield "The Last Light Passage" 17037.7 5589.1
    enemy "The Last Light Passage Guard 1"
    enemy "The Last Light Passage Guard 2"
    enemy "The Last Light Passage Guard 3"
    enemy "The Last Light Passage Guard 4"
    enemy "The Last Light Passage Guard 5"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Last Repair: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Five remaining Company warships protect the Meridian Star in the Last Light Passage.`
            `Ashcombe has no repair yard left and cannot afford another delay. His ships will fight hard to keep the flagship clear of the free fleet.`
            `The battle will decide whether the Meridian Star reaches the open ocean. The free captains are closing in from three directions.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The battle will decide whether the Meridian Star reaches the open ocean. The free captains are closing in from three directions.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The shipwright gives you the weak point on the chart. “One clean quartering pass. Do not let him turn his stern away.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Meridian Screen. Sink the five screen ships in the Last Light Passage, then return to Last Light for the final pursuit orders."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The screen collapses. A signal from Bonny reports that the Meridian Star has turned back toward Port Royal, hoping to reach the old harbour guns.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The chase has come full circle.`
        log "Completed The Meridian Screen. Received 1480 gold. The chase has come full circle."
